text But...
text As we enter the new building, {$lnmA} suddenly stops.
music BGM08D.mp3
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG18Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG18Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V1.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Just for a while longer...
sound 3V2.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text ...I want to be with her.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text As she's talking, her eyes are still watching the small girl running around with starfish in her hands.
text Ah, I see now...
text It's always been on {$lnmA}'s mind, even during our talk with the choral club moments ago...
text It's me who was the idiot.
text We cannot leave Fuko alone now and start to work toward our dream.
text Especially for {$lnmA}, whose heart is kinder than anyone else's...
text That's why she's going to give her dream up...
text ...for the girl who is trying harder than anyone else.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH20"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH20.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V3.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text Why? Nagisa-chan, did you lose interest in the drama club?
text Only the master of tactlessness, Sunohara, could ask such a question at a time like this.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG10.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V4.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text No... of course I still want to...
sound 3V5.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text But I think I'll delay the plans for the drama club a bit.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGSH15"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGSH15.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V6.aac
text @[Sunohara]
text What's wrong with starting it now...
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text That's right...
text Both of us have decided to help with whatever she's trying to do.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG10"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG10.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V7.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Not to mention... it's not just about working hard together.
text {$lnmA} continues her words.
sound 3V8.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text I want to eat together, to play together with her... a lot more.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG32"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG32.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3V9.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Because Fu-chan is...
text You don't have to say it.
text She hasn't been able to spend a single day here in this school.
text @[Tomoya]
text I know.
text I put my hand on her head.
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text Then together, we walk to Fuko's side. She is now making a starfish stand on her hand.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Fuko.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU19A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU19A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3VA.aac
text @[Fuko]
text ...?
text @[Tomoya]
text There's gonna be an event here called the School Founder's Festival.
sound 3VB.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Is that so?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. Everyone is really looking forward to it as a chance to relax.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's why even those third-years who are studying frantically are going to let off some steam...
text @[Tomoya]
text And who knows, they may even accept your starfish.
sound 3VC.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text Yes, that's true. They're going to accept it.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's right. Don't feel discouraged now.
text @[Tomoya]
text There's still time until the Founder's Festival. Let's take it easy.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU20A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU20A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3VD.aac
text @[Fuko]
text Yes.
text @[Tomoya]
text But that's not all...
text @[Tomoya]
text Fuko, spend some time to play with us.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU19A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU19A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Tomoya]
text You haven't exactly done anything in this school, have you?
sound 3VE.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text That's right, Fu-chan. There are lots of fun things to do.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU30A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU30A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text @[Fuko]
text ...
text Fuko gives it some thought...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGFU12A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGFU12A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
text ..and nods.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG23Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG23Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound 3VF.aac
text @[{$lnmA}]
text I'm so glad. Ehehe.
text {$lnmA} is smiling brightly as she gently strokes Fuko's head.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s16
fi
goto 19
label s16
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 19
setvar strS[1001] = "NONE"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
jump SEEN1502_0_0.scr
